{"tool_name":"larvalign","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"larvalign","home":"https://github.com/larvalign/larvalign/releases/tag/v1.0","summary":"Aligning Gene Expression Patterns from the Larval Brain of Drosophila melanogaster.","addition_date":"2018-08-05T09:30:25Z","last_update_date":"2018-12-10T12:59:01Z","tool_type":["Command-line tool"],"version":["1.0"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:larvalign","credit":[{"email":"dorit.merhof@lfb.rwth-aachen.de","name":"Dorit Merhof","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"]}],"documentation":[{"type":["General"],"url":"https://github.com/larvalign/larvalign/releases/tag/v1.0"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Image analysis","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3443"}]}],"name":"larvalign","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"d.gabrielaitis","publication":[{"doi":"10.1007/s12021-017-9349-6","metadata":{"abstract":"\u00a9 2017, The Author(s).The larval brain of the fruit fly Drosophila melanogaster is a small, tractable model system for neuroscience. Genes for fluorescent marker proteins can be expressed in defined, spatially restricted neuron populations. Here, we introduce the methods for 1) generating a standard template of the larval central nervous system (CNS), 2) spatial mapping of expression patterns from different larvae into a reference space defined by the standard template. We provide a manually annotated gold standard that serves for evaluation of the registration framework involved in template generation and mapping. A method for registration quality assessment enables the automatic detection of registration errors, and a semi-automatic registration method allows one to correct registrations, which is a prerequisite for a high-quality, curated database of expression patterns. All computational methods are available within the larvalign software package: https://github.com/larvalign/larvalign/releases/tag/v1.0.","authors":[{"name":"Buhler K."},{"name":"Merhof D."},{"name":"Muenzing S.E.A."},{"name":"Strauch M."},{"name":"Thum A.S."},{"name":"Truman J.W."}],"citationCount":7,"date":"2018-01-01T00:00:00Z","journal":"Neuroinformatics","title":"larvalign: Aligning Gene Expression Patterns from the Larval Brain of Drosophila melanogaster"},"pmcid":"PMC5797188","pmid":"29127664"}],"topic":[{"term":"Biological imaging","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3383"},{"term":"Mapping","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0102"},{"term":"Neurology","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3334"}],"validated":1},"bioschemas":{"name":"larvalign","home":"https://bio.tools/larvalign","version":"1.0","summary":"Aligning Gene Expression Patterns from the Larval Brain of Drosophila melanogaster.","tool_type":"sc:SoftwareApplication"},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:larvalign:1.0/cmd/github.com","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"biotools","@type":"metrics","deprecated":true,"distribution":{"binaries":{"freeness":null,"registration":null},"packages":null,"source_packages":false,"sourcecode":{"free":null,"interpreted":null,"license":null,"public":true,"readme":false,"repository":{"anonymous":null,"online":null}}},"project":{"build":{},"deployment":{},"documentation":{"general":true},"publications":[{"entries":[{"cit_count":0,"citations":[],"doi":"10.1007/s12021-017-9349-6","pmcid":"PMC5797188","pmid":"29127664","ref_count":29,"refs":[{"count":1,"year":"1993"},{"count":1,"year":"2000"},{"count":1,"year":"2004"},{"count":1,"year":"2007"},{"count":1,"year":"2014"},{"count":2,"year":"2003"},{"count":2,"year":"2006"},{"count":2,"year":"2008"},{"count":2,"year":"2009"},{"count":2,"year":"2010"},{"count":2,"year":"2015"},{"count":2,"year":"2016"},{"count":3,"year":"2012"},{"count":3,"year":"2013"},{"count":4,"year":"2011"}],"title":"larvalign: Aligning Gene Expression Patterns from the Larval Brain of Drosophila me